    detail "Battery reserve" | "31% is below the 35% planning threshold. Day 179: reserve fell below threshold after an extended communications window. Solar array reorientation is scheduled for day 190 and depends on reserve recovery."
    detail "Radiation exposure" | "7.8 mSv/day exceeds the 0–6 mSv/day planning range. Day 181: exposure exceeded the daily planning limit for six consecutive hours."
    detail "Navigation drift" | "0.014° is within the 0–0.020° nominal range. Day 183: navigation correction completed successfully and drift returned within tolerance."
