    event "DAY 179" | "Battery reserve below planning threshold" | "Reserve fell below 35% after an extended communications window."
    event "DAY 181" | "Radiation exposure above planning limit" | "Exposure exceeded the daily planning limit for six consecutive hours."
    event "DAY 183" | "Navigation correction completed" | "Correction completed successfully; drift returned within tolerance."
    event "DAY 184" | "Autonomous diagnostic cycle completed" | "Two alerts remain unresolved."
